#Parameters. Defaults shown in brackets apply if this file is not present.
0.08    # r - The birth rate of hares, defaults to 0.04
0.08    # a - The predation rate at which pumas eat hares (0.04)
0.04    # b - The birth rate of pumas per one hare eaten (0.02)
0.12    # m - The puma mortality rate (0.06)
0.40    # k - The diffusion rate for hares (0.2)
0.40    # l - The diffusion rate for pumas (0.2)
0.80    # dt - The time step (0.4)
20      # T - The total sim time (10)
200     # T_average - The iterations between averages (100)
